    "text": "The value of the definite integral&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to :"
